<https://ggen-igniter.dev/sjira/v26.9.23#P-42c9823adcd2e57c> <https://ggen-igniter.dev/ontology/semantic-jira#sourceText> "A goal is complete when:\n\n1. its required postconditions are observed;\n2. required dependencies have adequate standing;\n3. falsifiers do not fire;\n4. required receipts validate;\n5. replay requirements pass;\n6. no required hidden LLM/human edge remains;\n7. all remaining work is typed as successor, blocked, unsupported or refused." .
<https://ggen-igniter.dev/sjira/v26.9.23#P-42c9823adcd2e57c> <https://ggen-igniter.dev/ontology/semantic-jira#statement> "PR-017: a goal is complete when required postconditions are observed, dependencies have adequate standing, falsifiers do not fire, receipts validate, replay passes, no hidden LLM or human edge remains and all remaining work is typed." .
